# Scratch frames pulled out of screen recordings while diagnosing what a
# browser was actually showing. Working material, and they are pictures of
# somebody's screen — bookmarks bar, adjacent tabs and all. This is a public
# repository; they do not belong in it.
.rec*/

# The native app's web payload. Generated from public/demo/void-striker by
# mobile/void-striker/scripts/build-www.mjs, and copied into the iOS and
# Android projects from there by `cap sync` — three copies of a file that is
# already in the repository once.
mobile/*/www/
